(text "Miata ECU motherboard 1996-1997 (NA8 OBD2). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c055b755-8f5f-4dfc-ba67-7bd1a02465d8)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))